In the case of drug effect extraction it is clear
what we want to extract, and how it is structured.

A proposed rewrite is rejected if any of the following hold:
[leftmargin=1.2em]
    it is empty, non-responsive, or identical to the draft after normalization;
    for yes/no questions, it is not exactly yes or no;
    for entity-style questions, it is clause-like, overly long, or begins with a descriptor phrase;
    for temporal or numeric questions, it lacks an explicit temporal or numeric marker;
    the refiner provides no evidence snippet;
    lexical grounding between the revised answer and the cited evidence is too weak.
